<title>USA: BOXING-TALE OF THE TAPE FOR SELDON - TYSON.</title>
<headline>BOXING-TALE OF THE TAPE FOR SELDON - TYSON.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tale of the tape after the</p>
<p>weigh-in on Friday for the World Boxing Association</p>
<p>heavyweight title fight scheduled for 12 rounds between</p>
<p>champion Bruce Seldon and Mike Tyson on Saturday:</p>
<p>	Bruce Seldon				    Mike Tyson</p>
<p>	29			Age		     30</p>
<p>	229 lbs (103.8 kg)  Weight		  219 (99.3)</p>
<p>	6'2&quot; (1.87 m)	 Height		  5'11&quot; (1.52 m)</p>
<p>	79&quot; (200.6 cm)	Reach		   71&quot; (180.3 cm)</p>
<p>	44&quot; (111.7 cm)	Chest (Normal)	43&quot; (109 cm)</p>
<p>	46&quot; (116.8 cm)	Chest (Expanded)    45&quot; (114 cm)</p>
